<title>USA: Symbollon to withdraw disinfectant filing.</title>
<headline>Symbollon to withdraw disinfectant filing.</headline>
<dateline>SUDBURY, Mass. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Symbollon Corp said on Tuesday it agreed to withdraw a 510k pre-market notification filing to the U.S. Food and Drug Administration covering its high level disinfectant for reprocessing medical instruments.</p>
<p>The decision was prompted by concerns raised by the FDA regarding the sporicidal test results contained in the 510K, Symbollon said. The concerns focused on test protocol, the company said.</p>
</text>
